    [
     1,
     "<div>\r\n\r\n \r\n  \r\n  \r\n \r\n <div style=\"word-break:break-word\"><div style=\"line-height:1;padding:0.5em\">What exactly are you trying to achieve? Let&#39;s assume you want to extract the chi square value on each iteration, then you can save it into a simple vector and display the results after the loop. The way it is currently written down (sum &lt;-...) won&#39;t help you at all, because after the loop sum only stores the results of the last iteration or am I making a mistake here? <br>\r\n</div><div style=\"line-height:1;padding:0.3em\">Am 24.12.19, 13:26 schrieb &quot;Alicia FRANCO MARTÍNEZ&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">alic...@ucm.es</a>&gt;:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0.8ex 0pt 0pt 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n  <div dir=\"ltr\"></div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
