   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Okay! I already found the solution!<div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">quiet &lt;- function(fit) { </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  sink(tempfile()) </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  on.exit(sink()) </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  invisible(summary(fit, standardized = TRUE, fit.measures=TRUE)) </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">} </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">sum &lt;- quiet(fit)</font></div><div><br></div><div>Thank you anyway, I hope this could help someone in the future!</div><div><br></div><div>Alicia.</div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
